[C#m] Apne hi ghar me hai [G#m] bhatke hue,        Haye [F#m] kitne bechare [G#m] hue hai
Kaise [C#m] haste the hum Kaise [B] rone lage,        Haal [A] kya kar diya Ye [G#m] tere pyar [C#m] ne
Kaise [C#m] haste thhe hum Kaise [B] rone lage
Haal [F#m] kya kar [B] diya Ye [G#m] tere pyar [C#m] ne
[C#m] Sine me jinke hum [B] Dil banke rehte thhe,        [A] Kya kya wo kehte the [G#m] Ab kya [C#m] kahe
[C#m] Raston pe meri jo [B] Palke bichhate thhe,        [F#m] Raste pe wo humko [B] chhod [C#m] chale
Jaise [A] doobe kinare [G#m] hue hain,        Hum to [F#] tute sitare [G#m] hue hain
[C#m] Tere sitam leke [B] phirte hai hum,        [F#] Tere gamm ke sawaare [B] hue [G#m]
Jeete [C#m] jeete sanam Lash [B] hone lage,        Yoon [F#m] tabaah kar [B] diya hai
[G#m] Tere pyaar [C#m] ne,        Kaise [C#m] haste thhe hum Kaise [B] rone lage
